l change that. Since no Companion material has been released yet, I have had no chance to add them in.<br /> <br /> <b>Solar </b>cascades are on Version3 and await a round of bugfixes if I can get my ass off the chair and actually do it. Currently still lacking Arms of the Chosen content. <hr /><br /> <span style=\"font-size:20px\"><b>Lunar Cascades </b></span><b>A combined PDF version, including all ability cascades:</b> <a href=\"http://www.madletter.net/rpg/exalted/cascades/lunar_v1/cascade_lunar_v1_all.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a><ul><li>Universal --- <a href=\"http://www.madletter.net/rpg/exalted/cascades/lunar_v1/cascade_lunar_v1_universal.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">PDF</a> / <a href=\"http://www.madletter.net/rpg/exalted/cascades/lunar_v1/cascade_lunar_v1_universal.png\" target=\"_blank\">PNG</a></li> <li>Strength --- <a href=\"http://www.madletter.net/rpg/exalted/cascades/lunar_v1/cascade_lunar_v1_strength.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">PDF</a> / PNGs: <a href=\"http://www.madletter.net/rpg/exalted/cascades/lunar_v1/cascade_lunar_v1_strength_offense.png\" target=\"_blank\">Offense</a> \u00b7 <a href=\"http://www.madletter.net/rpg/exalted/cascades/lunar_v1/cascade_lunar_v1_strength_mobility.png\" target=\"_blank\">Mobility</a> \u00b7 <a href=\"http://www.madletter.net/rpg/exalted/cascades/lunar_v1/cascade_lunar_v1_strength_feats_of_strength.png\" target=\"_blank\">Feats of Strength</a></li> <li>Dexterity --- <a href=\"http://www.madletter.net/rpg/exalted/cascades/lunar_v1/cascade_lunar_v1_dexterity.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">PDF</a> / PNGs: <a href=\"http://www.madletter.net/rpg/exalted/cascades/lunar_v1/cascade_lunar_v1_dexterity_offense.png\" target=\"_blank\">Offensive</a> \u00b7 <a href=\"http://www.madletter.net/rpg/exalted/cascades/lunar_v1/cascade_lunar_v1_dexterity_defense.png\" target=\"_blank\">Defense</a> \u00b7 <a href=\"http://www.madletter.net/rpg/exalted/cascades/lunar_v1/cascade_lunar_v1_dexterity_subterfuge.png\" target=\"_blank\">Subterfuge</a> \u00b