uence sections on the Lunar social trees are big enough that I wonder if they should maybe be subdivided onto multiple pages? I mean, in Charisma, the tree coming off Beast King Dictates and the one coming off Charismatic Lunar Trick don't interconnect at all, so putting them on separate pages might increase readability without requiring much work.<br /> <br /> Appearance might be trickier, but if you could offload the charms that tree just off of Seductive Moonlit Dream or Glace-Oration Technique onto other pages, it could maybe get rid of those places you're having to jump lines over other lines.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-24T06:35:49-07:00","id":1299194,"title":"","content":"Perception is up now as well!<br /> <br /> i fixed the broken link, the rest I'll fix in my revision/fixing pass after I did all the cascades once.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar226_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"226\" data-vbnamecard=\"226\">BrilliantRain</a> I am honestly not sure if I wanna redo parts of the layout. That part is always a bitch and so long as a cascade falls under the same topic I would generally like to keep them together as well. The Cascades are designed primarily for digital use where scrolling should hopefully not be too much of an issue. I can see where some of them grow fairly sizable though...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/322-madletter","name":"MadLetter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar322_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-24T10:32:19-07:00","id":1299265,"title":"","content":"Think I see a typo. Under Lunar Dexterity charms -- &quot;swam&quot;. Should that be &quot;swarm&quot;?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11847-kfinigan","name":"KFinigan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-24T12:34:57-07:00","id":1299318,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MadLetter</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1297480-madletter-s-charm-cascades-lunars-solars-dragon-blooded?p=1299194#post1299194\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Perception is up now as well!<br /> <br /> i fixed the broken link, the rest I'll fix in my revision/fixing pass after I did all the cascades once.<br /> <br /> <span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span> I am honestly not sure if I wanna redo parts of the layout. That part is always a bitch and so long as a cascade falls under the same topic I would generally like to keep them together as well. The Cascades are designed primarily for digital use where scrolling should hopefully not be too much of an issue. I can see where some of them grow fairly sizable though...</div> </div> </div> </div>Fair enough. It was just a thought.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-24T13:18:35-07:00","id":1299361,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/322-madletter\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar322_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"322\" data-vbnamecard=\"322\">MadLetter</a> I like what you're doing.<br /> <br /> As a fellow toolmaker (not as active as you are on the social networks though) I really feel how much work you put behind.<br /> <br /> So thank you for it ! And please keep going I can't choose my charms without that stuff of your !","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>French Exalt &amp; ST &amp; ToolMaker [<a href=\"http://refhi.free.fr/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>]<br /> Advanced Character Generator <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1087290-advanced-character-generator#post1087290\" target=\"_blank\">Thread, </a><a href=\"http://refhi.free.fr/exalted3/Fiche%20perso%20colab.xlsx\" target=\"_blank\">Excel Version</a> &amp; <a href=\"http://refhi.free.fr/exalted3/Fiche%20perso%20colab.ods\" target=\"_blank\">LibreOffice Version</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1141199-exalted-3-familiar-generator\" target=\"_blank\">Familiar Generator Thread</a> &amp; <a href=\"http://refhi.free.fr/exalted3/Familiar%20Generator.ods\" target=\"_blank\">Libreoffice Version</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13355-refhi","name":"Refhi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13355_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"147"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-24T13:54:23-07:00","id":1299375,"title":"","content":"You could put these up on DrivethruRPG now that Exalted is part of the Storyteller's Vault.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-24T14:50:00-07:00","id":1299409,"title":"","content":"Thanks <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13355-refhi\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar13355_2.gif');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"13355\" data-vbnamecard=\"13355\">Refhi</a> for the kind words, and cheers to a fellow community contributor! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Only &quot;social network&quot; I even have an account for is reddit, though :P<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar226_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"226\" data-vbnamecard=\"226\">BrilliantRain</a> Just want to make sure: Input is most certainly welcome, some of it is just unfeasible at times due to the necessary work involved. Still, feel free to keep the suggestions going, I will consider them all carefully! As for the Storytellers Vault... I will try to get an appointment with the tax office and see what's necessary on my end to set up all Cascades as a &quot;Pay What You Want&quot; offering on the shop. But one thing is certain: The Cascades will always be available for free, specifically on my own server and the Vault once I upload it there. I just wanna give people the option to &quot;tip&quot; a little if they care as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/322-madletter","name":"MadLetter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar322_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-25T06:21:43-07:00","id":1299574,"title":"","content":"These are absolutely essential, and their lack is one of my greatest disappointments in the E3 materials. I would absolutely toss some money their way if they show up in the Vault.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1096-squidheadjax","name":"squidheadjax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1096_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-25T06:55:47-07:00","id":1299582,"title":"","content":"Thank you very much. You've done an amazing work<br /> You've made my ST role way easier with this","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12575-gaara","name":"Gaara","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"62"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-02T04:26:54-07:00","id":1301853,"title":"","content":"Great stuff! Thanks!<br /> <br /> But yeah, you might want to consider selling them on the vault.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-03T12:08:23-07:00","id":1302295,"title":"","content":"Hey folks, I had a bit of a busy last week, trying to scramble to get my own Exalted campaign going again, thus no Cascades. I am back today for Stamina, though, so enjoy that one!<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar2402_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2402\" data-vbnamecard=\"2402\">The Wizard of Oz</a> I will likely get a chance to clear that in the coming weeks, but one thing I will reiterate because I wanna make it clear: While I may offer them up as Pay What You Want, the Cascades themselves will always remain free, at least on my own server!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/322-madletter","name":"MadLetter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar322_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-03T13:29:41-07:00","id":1302316,"title":"","content":"Okay fuck it.<br /> <br /> Double Trouble: Strength is here!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/322-madletter","name":"MadLetter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar322_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-14T10:06:14-07:00","id":1304827,"title":"","content":"Took a while, but it's finally done -- <b>PHASE ONE IS COMPLETE</b><br /> <br /> What does that mean? It means all cascades have page numbers and all Charms present (went over App/Cha to get the pagenumbers in and fix some typos). What's next? Chilling a bit, and then adding in all Totemic Charms and fixing all typos.<br /> <br /> IMPORTANT: IF YOU FIND ERRORS OR TYPOS PLEASE INPUT THEM INTO THE GOOGLE DOCS FILE I LINKED IN THE FIRST POST!<br /> <br /> Cheers folks, here's the quick-link to the &quot;all in&quot; PDF for Lunars: <a href=\"http://www.madletter.net/rpg/exalted/cascades/lunar_v1/cascade_lunar_v1_all.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/322-madletter","name":"MadLetter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar322_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-02T15:52:04-08:00","id":1364864,"title":"","content":"I love the Charm Cascades and use them very often. They look wonderful and are super useful. So thank you so much!<br /> <br /> Yesterday while playing a session what I realized I needed (and think other players also need) is a handy way to visually see what charms in the cascades we have. <br /> <br /> Is there a way to add a tick box or check box to the charm cascades (possibly including repurchases?) so that we can quickly see which charms we have in the trees?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11847-kfinigan","name":"KFinigan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"218"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}